{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117850","id":3448175762,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7NhvyS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117850","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117850.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117850.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117850","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117850/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117850/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117850/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0636f7adff9a6495f2aef85fe387ff306cf6a85d","number":117850,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Reduce `RefCounted` copies in `GDScriptFunction::call`","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Related to #117121.\r\n\r\nAs [talked about](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/gdscript?msg=pBRsJstLjavoPhqHh) on the contributor's chat, in a GDScript-heavy real-world project that we've been profiling there seems to be a troubling amount of overhead coming from `RefCounted::reference`/`RefCounted::unreference`, a big chunk of which is coming from initializing these `Variant` instances here, as the GDScript VM puts the script and instance references onto the GDScript stack:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/60fff00a660a2aeb03f88c07fb7baed353bcb72f/modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp#L656-L663\r\n\r\nThe reference count increment/decrement that come as a result of this are seemingly entirely redundant, as ~~both~~ the script ~~and instance~~ by definition (?) have to survive the entire function call.\r\n\r\nThis pull request fixes that by introducing a `VariantInternal::object_assign_raw`, which allows us to (dangerously) write the object pointer/ID/type into the GDScript stack `Variant` without incrementing the reference counter. Then we simply don't run the destructor for these at all, thereby avoiding decrementing the reference counter as well.\r\n\r\nI'll see if I can provide some hard numbers from Tracy later on, ~~but we're seeing somewhere on the order of a 10% bump in performance from this in one particular benchmark in this particular project.~~","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"miles